node_modules
npm-debug.log
.next
.env
.env.local
.git
.gitignore
README.md
.DS_Store
dist
build
coverage
*.log

# Root context builds (see docker-compose.yml / docker-compose.prod.yml)
# COPY workspace subtrees (apps/dashboard, packages/gateway) whole; the
# plain patterns above only match a top-level match, not nested workspace
# dirs (dockerignore patterns are not implicitly recursive like gitignore's).
# Without these, a host-side node_modules/.next/dist/tsbuildinfo lands in
# the build context and gets COPYed over the fresh `npm ci` / `npm run
# build` tree inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.production.example
